+# TLS Certificate Verification (Development Builds)
+
+This project has no current recorded decision on TLS certificate verification in development builds. A prior workaround disabling certificate verification in dev builds was mentioned, and a follow-up conversation raised ending that workaround in favor of verification on all builds, but neither was ever finalized into a recorded project decision (e.g. via a committed decision record), so no policy value is confirmed at this time.
